x_pv_image" value="same name&lt;br&gt;PV imageName = RBD image csi-vol-&amp;lt;uuid&amp;gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fontColor=#7F6000;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="C5pv" target="A6test"><mxGeometry x="-0.4290" y="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0.0" y="-22.0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1016.0" y="1157.0"/><mxPoint x="1016.0" y="1154.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="B1" value="&lt;b&gt;LAN 192.168.200.0/24&lt;/b&gt; · gateway .1&lt;br&gt;vmbr0 on both Proxmox hosts → one L2 segment, no routing, no firewall in between&lt;br&gt;ceph1 = &lt;b&gt;.66&lt;/b&gt; · SNO node = &lt;b&gt;.100&lt;/b&gt; (br&amp;#8209;ex)&lt;br&gt;MTU 1500 everywhere" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;" vertex="1" parent="B"><mxGeometry x="12.0" y="44.0" width="196.0" height="103.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="B2" value="&lt;b&gt;Both sides&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;chrony → stratum-2 NTP (puck.cbk.poznan.pl); Ceph tolerates &amp;lt; 50 ms skew&lt;br&gt;ports reached from the node: 3300, 6789 (MON) · 6800–7300 (OSD/MGR); tested with oc&amp;nbsp;debug&amp;nbsp;node + /dev/tcp&lt;br&gt;no OSD address is configured anywhere" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;" vertex="1" parent="B"><mxGeometry x="12.0" y="441.4" width="196.0" height="142.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="B3" value="&lt;b&gt;Planned — step 1b: dedicated storage link&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2nd NIC per VM (VLAN tag on vmbr0 or vmbr1), e.g. 10.10.20.0/24, &lt;b&gt;no gateway / no DHCP&lt;/b&gt; · SNO: NodeNetworkConfigurationPolicy (NMState) · Ceph: MON/OSD on the new subnet · CephConnection.monitors → new IP · ctrlplugin hostNetwork" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;fontColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="B"><mxGeometry x="12.0" y="690.8" width="196.0" height="142.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="L" value="Legend" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=28;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDEDED;strokeColor=#666666;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1301.0" width="980.0" height="310.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc0" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFBF6;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="42.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt0" value="orange lane = Ceph side (step 1, everything lives in VM ceph1)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="39.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc1" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;swimlaneFillColor=#F7FAFF;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="73.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt1" value="blue lane = OpenShift side (step 2)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="70.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc2" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;swimlaneFillColor=#F7FBF6;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="104.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt2" value="green lane = the network between the two VMs" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="101.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc3" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="135.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt3" value="yellow = value that must be identical on both sides (copied Ceph → OpenShift)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="132.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc4" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#E8DDF0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="166.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt4" value="purple = runtime object created &amp;amp; owned by the Ceph-CSI Operator — never written by hand" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="163.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc5" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="197.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt5" value="gray = pre-existing on the cluster, left untouched" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="194.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc6" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;fontColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="228.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt6" value="dashed border = planned (step 1b storage network · step 3 VM)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="225.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lc7" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="259.0" width="46.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lt7" value="red = known pitfall and its fix" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="256.0" width="430.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea0" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="50.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb0" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="50.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea0" target="Leb0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let0" value="solid black arrow = references by name (clusterID, cephConnectionRef, secret names, storageClassName, claimName)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="36.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea1" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="92.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb1" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="92.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#5E3A7A;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea1" target="Leb1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let1" value="dashed purple arrow = created / rendered by the operator (ownerReference → Driver CR)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="78.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea2" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="134.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb2" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="134.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee2" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;fontColor=#B85450;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea2" target="Leb2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let2" value="dotted red arrow = SecurityContextConstraints granted to the driver ServiceAccounts" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="120.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea3" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="176.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb3" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="176.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee3" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=3.5;fontColor=#1B5E20;fontStyle=1;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea3" target="Leb3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let3" value="thick green arrow = traffic over the LAN (control: librados from the ctrlplugin pod · data: krbd from the node kernel)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="162.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea4" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="218.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb4" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="218.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee4" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fontColor=#7F6000;fontStyle=1;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea4" target="Leb4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let4" value="dashed gold line = the same value on both sides (address, pool name, credentials, image name)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="204.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lea5" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="520.0" y="260.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Leb5" value="" style="shape=ellipse;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="260.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Lee5" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;fontColor=#666666;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Lea5" target="Leb5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="Let5" value="dotted gray arrow = planned" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="L"><mxGeometry x="616.0" y="246.0" width="350.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="K" value="Key facts to remember" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=28;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDEDED;strokeColor=#666666;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050.0" y="1301.0" width="1250.0" height="310.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="K1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. clusterID is a name, not the fsid.&lt;/b&gt; With the operator, StorageClass.parameters.clusterID must equal the ClientProfile's metadata.name (&quot;ceph1&quot;). The Ceph fsid appears nowhere on the OpenShift side.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. The OpenShift key must be of type aes.&lt;/b&gt; Ceph ≥ 20.2.4 / 19.2.6 creates aes256k keys by default (CVE-2025-30156 fix); the RHCOS 5.14 kernel cannot authenticate with them → ceph mon set auth_allowed_ciphers aes,aes256k + ceph auth get-or-create client.ocp-rbd --key-type aes … (the key starts with &quot;AQ&quot;).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Only MON addresses are configured on OpenShift.&lt;/b&gt; A client authenticates at the MON, downloads the OSD map and then talks to every OSD directly (ports 6800–7300) — OSDs must be reachable from the node, but are never listed anywhere.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Two network paths, one source IP (for now).&lt;/b&gt; Provisioning comes from the ctrlplugin pod (SNAT to the node IP); I/O comes from the node kernel (hostNetwork). Ceph sees both as 192.168.200.100. After step 1b the storage-subnet address shows up instead — the proof that traffic moved." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="K"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="36.0" width="600.0" height="264.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="K2" value='&lt;b&gt;5. The operator is a YAML install, not OLM.&lt;/b&gt; It is invisible under Installed Operators; look at Workloads → Deployments. The SCC ClusterRole must be patched (manifest bug) before any driver pod can start.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. The six 30 GiB images are not a leak.&lt;/b&gt; is-default-virt-class on ceph-rbd makes OpenShift Virtualization import its golden images onto Ceph (DataImportCron). 30 GiB is virtual; ~1–2 GiB each is really used. Disable with enableCommonBootImageImport=false if unwanted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. Replication = 2 of 3 OSDs on one physical SSD.&lt;/b&gt; --single-host-defaults uses failure domain osd, size 2 / min_size 1: it survives a failed OSD daemon, not the single disk. The Proxmox snapshot "ceph-ready" is the real backup of the lab.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8. One pool = one application.&lt;/b&gt; ocp-rbd is tagged rbd → block images only (RWO). RWX would need CephFS (own pools + MDS + own user + the cephfs driver).' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="K"><mxGeometry x="632.0" y="36.0" width="602.0" height="264.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>